<SPT><TTL>WARRANTY</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>[Provide warranties as specified in this Section.]  Refer to Article WARRANTY in Section <SRF>11 70 00</SRF> GENERAL REQUIREMENTS 
